    "title": "Hoboken Man Makes FBI's Most Wanted Fraudsters List. First Ever in New Jersey. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tom Lavecchia ,\n1 days ago Rey E. Grabato II, who lived in Hoboken before becoming a fugitive, has made history in a way nobody wants to. That is unless you have a knack for crime. He’s the first New Jersey resident ever added to the FBI’s Most Wanted Fraudsters list, a designation tied to a $650 million Ponzi scheme that defrauded roughly 2,000 investors, including hundreds across New Jersey. Read full article\n2",
